# Memory-calibration capture scratch (docs/memory-calibration-harness.md). MUST stay ignored: the
# harness derives each record's `dirty` flag from `git status --porcelain`, which counts untracked
# paths, and complete evidence from a dirty repository is rejected outright.
.tmp/
